<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-10-26T15:20:35.332Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 15:20:35 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Algeria’s Senate has approved the deployment of soldiers to Niger to protect energy assets, marking the country’s first foreign deployment in over 50 years. In eastern Nigeria, gunmen killed at least ten people, and separate motorbike gunmen killed at least twenty civilians in a village, showing continued attacks on civilians. Mali’s military raised the death toll from a recent attack to fifty-four, indicating intensified fighting there. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;myMotherLode.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE5CTDUzbGhrRFJCS1E5M0h3eHV0N1FCSmVyQzM3WVQ4eEZkSmwwNWtNRGVaVU9CMHotMElfcnZhYXBMaGZ4ci1uVnJqNHZQdWx0cXVnaE85S2tXd0FnNV9GY1ZFM01kV1JYRUxHWkxxZVNsS3hLaWlLWlpITQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;thefact.ng&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQS3VfUjBmNi1vbGlWeUJlYTZfMDdUZWZkV1hFLXgyZ1JRYUhicFVPRzZHbjI2MC1DNGY1cHpGbF8xSWdvU3Y2Wm9McnZjemlDN0dibDJLcTlVcm5FeTgtcWRNLUw4bm1WX0F2OEV5WENWRTN0MGZtV0VwLXhINWxBbWhfTm93ckkwd3Ita2taeDh1VnRCVHh3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Channels Television&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNSE8xTG9RMk1HR1RjMjJZV2VsTmJLNE41QUJhaGZWOTJUOEJPVndPVkRiWVhDRXduZ1otTllfYVFQSXVaZ0JIaVRHQWNQTzE1MEVldHZXQjg5YVV4TllZSUQwM3hvLXE5dWV3dVo2aVhKMHZaTmN1SzJBZ2owZXBEdDR4WnpmRVlNT1pvRDVsRzNJcXVaSGJvUDN2dGVxekZxZ2hz?oc=5&quot;&gt;entrevue.fr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxPOFpOcUNsVVlSRmthY1JVR0Vvd2szMUNyT0lyeXlYbUw1cE9feE44eERVQ0pJdHdrOUVMUkZLSlZBdjhvb09uM3ZTalRXVHlVZkdJSnczUXRjUUI1cjVTdTVQbmhkLUpEOUg4S3p